# Indonesian UI string catalogue for awcms-astro.
#
# These are INTERFACE strings, not content. Content lives in awcms and is
# translated by editors there; this catalogue is part of the template and is
# translated by whoever maintains the repo. A missing key falls back to the
# default locale and then to the key itself, so an untranslated catalogue
# degrades to a readable page rather than to raw key names on screen.
